@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@invoiceNumber = INV-TEST-001

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/vendor-payable/invoice/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "{{invoiceNumber}}",
  "invoiceDate": "2026-07-02",
  "vendorName": "Test Vendor",
  "gstin": "29ABCDE1234F1Z5",
  "baseAmount": 10000,
  "dueDate": "2026-07-15",
  "expenseType": "Software",
  "vendorType": "Registered",
  "discount": 500,
  "subTotal": 9500,
  "accountNumber": "12345678901",
  "gst": 18,
  "ifsc": "HDFC0001234",
  "invoiceAmount": 11210,
  "paymentFrequency": "Immediate",
  "tds": 10,
  "scheduledDate": "2026-07-10",
  "paymentAmount": 10210,
  "paidAmount": 0,
  "dueAmount": 10210,
  "description": "API test invoice",
  "paymentTerms": "Net 15",
  "amountToVendor": 9210
}

### Get all invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/vendor-payable/invoice/getAllInvoice

### Get invoice by number
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/vendor-payable/invoice/{{invoiceNumber}}

### Update invoice
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/vendor-payable/invoice/{{invoiceNumber}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorName": "Updated Test Vendor",
  "paidAmount": 2500,
  "dueAmount": 7710,
  "description": "Updated through API test"
}

### Duplicate invoice check - should return 409 after create succeeds once
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/vendor-payable/invoice/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "{{invoiceNumber}}",
  "invoiceDate": "2026-07-02",
  "vendorName": "Test Vendor",
  "gstin": "29ABCDE1234F1Z5",
  "baseAmount": 10000,
  "dueDate": "2026-07-15",
  "expenseType": "Software",
  "vendorType": "Registered",
  "discount": 500,
  "subTotal": 9500,
  "accountNumber": "12345678901",
  "gst": 18,
  "ifsc": "HDFC0001234",
  "invoiceAmount": 11210,
  "paymentFrequency": "Immediate",
  "tds": 10,
  "scheduledDate": "2026-07-10",
  "paymentAmount": 10210,
  "paidAmount": 0,
  "dueAmount": 10210,
  "description": "Duplicate test invoice",
  "paymentTerms": "Net 15",
  "amountToVendor": 9210
}

### Get all settlements
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/vendor-payable/settlement

### Get settlements with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/vendor-payable/settlement?invoiceId={{invoiceNumber}}&paymentStatus=SUCCESS&payment_gateway=razorpay

### Get settlement by invoice id
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/vendor-payable/settlement/{{invoiceNumber}}
